/build
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
# Background originals and PNG masters stay local; design/backgrounds/README.md says how to make them
design/backgrounds/*.png
design/backgrounds/masters/*.png
# The icon's masters stay local; design/icon/README.md says where they come from
design/icon/*.png
src/main/draughts.png
# Generated tabletops stay local until the user agrees (task 016)
design/tabletops/*.png
# Release signing stays outside the repo
*.jks
*.keystore
upload-key.properties
# The previews' images, copied by store/preview/build.py from outside git
store/preview/img/

# Shots of the 3D boards for the prototypes, made with build/board_shot (tools/board_shot.goose, prototypes/README.md)
prototypes/shots/
# Freesound previews and hits the removed tools/sound_samples.py made (task 089); local
prototypes/samples/
# The sounds' original recordings stay local; task 089 says where they come from
design/sounds/*.wav
design/manor/*.png
# The props' references stay local; each folder's README.md lists them (design/props/)
design/props/*/*.png
design/props/*/*.jpg
design/props/*/*.mp4
